                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]A pleasant typical old-school platformer, referring to and styling itself with Sonic[/h1]\nThe difficulty balance is decent, plus a lot of ideas for diversifying the gameplay will ensure that people who like this type of atmosphere will not get bored quickly, the only drawback for me was the graphics or rather the lopsidedness of models/animation, but still, since it's supposed to fit into a certain outline of a retro game, you can get over it. \n\nIf you can find it in the bundle and you like this type of game, it's worth a try, it may not be something incredibly extra, but it's a reasonable paltformer in which you can find a challenge.",
